---
import RuLayout from '../../layouts/RuLayout.astro';
const services=[
 ['01','Qualification','Scope / Authority Triage','Free','20 минут','Один external effect, требуемая authority, owner и наличие staging/test path. Результат: audit / no-audit decision.','/ru/audit-intake','Подготовить triage brief'],
 ['02','Narrow uncertainty','Entry Audit','$1,500','fixed','Одна critical action chain + одна primary hypothesis + bounded reproduction + finding memo.','/ru/audit-intake','Подготовить Entry scope'],
 ['03','Primary authority decision','Agent Authority & Evidence Audit','$4,900','fixed','Один staging workflow, до 3 integrations, 10–20 scenarios, 8 deliverables и один retest.','/ru/audit-intake','Подготовить Primary scope'],
 ['04','After verified findings','Hardening & Repair','Quoted','separately','Implementation только после verified finding, с owner decision, rollback requirements и retest criteria.','/ru/pricing','Scope rules']
];
const owners=[['Product / AI Product','Можно ли дать workflow больше автономии без потери defensible action boundary?'],['Platform / Engineering','Retries, object binding, external confirmation и recovery остаются coherent under failure?'],['Security / Assurance','Можно ли reconstruct authorization, evidence, effect и containment?'],['Founder / Operations','Что оставить autonomous, что constrain и какой evidence нужен до expansion?']];
---
<RuLayout title="BitEvo Services — русская decision ladder" description="Русская BitEvo service ladder: free authority triage, $1,500 Entry Audit, $4,900 Primary Audit и evidence-led hardening." enPath="/consulting" ruPath="/ru/consulting">
<section class="section hero"><div class="container split"><div><div class="eyebrow">Engineering decision ladder</div><h1 class="display">Давать workflow только ту authority, которую поддерживает evidence.</h1></div><div><p class="lede">Лестница engagement начинается с critical action и заканчивается repair только после verified finding. Budget меняется, метод — нет.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/ru/diagnostic">7-gate diagnostic ↗</a><a class="button" href="/mapper">Mapper (EN)</a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section-tight section-rule"><div class="container stack">{services.map(([n,eyebrow,name,price,timing,text,href,cta],i)=><article class:list={['service panel',i===2&&'primary']}><span class="n">{n}</span><div><div class="eyebrow">{eyebrow}</div><h2>{name}</h2><p>{text}</p></div><div class="side"><strong>{price}</strong><small>{timing}</small><a class:list={['button',i===2&&'button-primary']} href={href}>{cta} →</a></div></article>)}</div><div class="container public panel"><div class="eyebrow">Public-site handoff</div><strong>Сайт не book-ит triage, не отправляет audit request и не authorizes testing.</strong><p>RU intake генерирует local scope brief. Scheduling, payment и written RoE продолжаются только через отдельно согласованный business channel.</p></div></section>
<section class="section section-rule"><div class="container split"><div><div class="eyebrow">Owner map</div><h2 class="section-title">Один workflow. Разные owner questions.</h2></div><p class="lede">Метод тот же, но decision зависит от роли. Поэтому owner question фиксируется до testing.</p></div><div class="container owners">{owners.map(([role,q],i)=><article class="panel"><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><small>{role}</small><h3>{q}</h3></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="section section-rule"><div class="narrow"><div class="eyebrow">Invariant</div><h2 class="section-title">Workflow before model. Evidence before effect. Owner decision before remediation.</h2><p class="lede">External effect должен быть подтверждён отдельно от внутреннего completion. Иначе apparent success может быть False Green.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/ru/artifacts">Рабочие artifacts →</a><a class="button" href="/ru/doctrine">Доктрина</a></div></div></section>
</RuLayout>
<style>.hero{padding-top:clamp(68px,9vw,118px)}.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(38px,7vw,96px);align-items:start}.actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px}.stack{display:grid;gap:12px}.service{display:grid;grid-template-columns:45px 1fr 175px;gap:24px;align-items:center;padding:26px}.service.primary{border-color:rgba(127,208,177,.35)}.n{align-self:start;color:var(--green);font:500 .6rem var(--mono)}.service h2{margin:6px 0 8px}.service p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}.side{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end}.side>strong{font-size:1.55rem}.side>small{color:var(--muted);font:500 .6rem var(--mono);margin-bottom:16px}.side .button{width:100%}.public{margin-top:16px;padding:22px;border-color:rgba(215,197,143,.22)}.public>strong{display:block;margin:6px 0}.public p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}.owners{margin-top:36px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.owners article{padding:24px;min-height:240px}.owners span{color:var(--green);font:500 .58rem var(--mono)}.owners small{display:block;margin-top:32px;color:var(--muted);font:500 .58rem var(--mono);text-transform:uppercase}.owners h3{margin:10px 0;font-size:1.15rem}@media(max-width:900px){.split{grid-template-columns:1fr}.service{grid-template-columns:35px 1fr}.side{grid-column:2;align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:row;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.side>small{margin:0;align-self:center}.side .button{width:auto;margin-left:auto}}@media(max-width:620px){.service{grid-template-columns:1fr}.n{display:none}.side{grid-column:auto;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}.side .button{width:100%;margin-left:0}.owners{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
